    {
      "id": "step-execution",
      "heading": "Step Execution",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "A StepExecution represents a single attempt to execute a Step.",
            "A new StepExecution is created each time a Step is run, similar to JobExecution.",
            "However, if a step fails to execute because the step before it fails, no execution is persisted for it.",
            "A StepExecution is created only when its Step is actually started."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/Users/luffy/Desktop/Computer Science/Infosys/Spring Batch/Core Components/Core%20Components/image%208.png",
          "alt": "image.png",
          "originalPath": "Core%20Components/image%208.png"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "",
          "code": "Job\n └── JobInstance\n      └── JobExecution (attempt 1)\n            └── StepExecution (step1)\n            └── StepExecution (step2)",
          "runnable": false
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 54,
      "subsections": []
